{"topic": "Gradient Descent and Learning Rate", "audience": "", "brief": {"objective": "学生能复述本页核心结论", "keyClaim": "学习率调度：从固定到自适应", "misconception": "", "visualTask": "视觉直接编码本页核心关系", "evidencePolicy": "none"}, "scene": {"id": "learning-rate-schedule", "kind": "content", "eyebrow": "工程实践", "headline": "学习率调度：从固定到自适应", "lead": "固定学习率在训练后期易导致震荡或收敛缓慢；自适应调度通过动态调整学习率，在早期快速下降、后期精细收敛。", "notes": "对比三种常见调度策略的曲线形态，理解其设计动机与适用场景。", "blocks": [{"type": "sim", "engine": "widget", "html": "<style>
  .lab { background: var(--bg2); border-radius: var(--radius, 12px); padding: 20px; color: var(--ink); height: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; display: flex; flex-direction: column; }
  .lab canvas { display: block; width: 100%; max-width: 680px; height: auto; margin: 0 auto; background: var(--card); border-radius: var(--radius, 8px); cursor: pointer; flex: 1; }
  .readout { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 16px; margin-top: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap; }
  .readout .item { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px; font-size: 12px; }
  .readout .dot { width: 10px; height: 10px; border-radius: 50%; flex-shrink: 0; }
  .readout .val { font-family: var(--mono); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; font-size: 13px; min-width: 48px; }
  .readout .label { color: var(--text2); font-size: 11px; letter-spacing: .04em; }
  .readout .step-label { color: var(--text2); font-size: 11px; margin-right: 4px; }
  .readout .step-val { font-family: var(--mono); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; font-size: 13px; min-width: 28px; }
  .readout .phase { font-size: 11px; padding: 2px 8px; border-radius: 4px; background: var(--bg2); color: var(--text2); }
</style>
<div class="lab">
  <canvas id="stage" width="680" height="320"></canvas>
  <div class="readout">
    <span class="step-label">step</span>
    <span class="step-val mono" id="stepDisplay">10</span>
    <span class="item"><span class="dot" style="background:var(--accent)"></span><span class="label">Step Decay</span><span class="val mono" id="lrStepDisplay">0.100</span></span>
    <span class="item"><span class="dot" style="background:var(--accent)"></span><span class="label">Cosine</span><span class="val mono" id="lrCosineDisplay">0.095</span></span>
    <span class="item"><span class="dot" style="background:var(--accent)"></span><span class="label">Warmup</span><span class="val mono" id="lrWarmupDisplay">0.040</span></span>
    <span class="phase" id="phaseDisplay">warmup</span>
  </div>
</div>
<script>
  (function() {
    const root = document.documentElement;
    const tok = n => getComputedStyle(root).getPropertyValue(n).trim();
    const canvas = document.getElementById('stage');
    const ctx = canvas.getContext('2d');
    const W = 680, H = 320;
    const padL = 60, padR = 20, padT = 20, padB = 30;
    const plotW = W - padL - padR;
    const plotH = H - padT - padB;
    const maxStep = 200;
    const maxLR = 0.2;

    let step = 10;
    let lr_step = 0.1;
    let lr_cosine = 0.095;
    let lr_warmup = 0.04;
    let warmup_phase = true;
    let playing = true;

    const stepDisplay = document.getElementById('stepDisplay');
    const lrStepDisplay = document.getElementById('lrStepDisplay');
    const lrCosineDisplay = document.getElementById('lrCosineDisplay');
    const lrWarmupDisplay = document.getElementById('lrWarmupDisplay');
    const phaseDisplay = document.getElementById('phaseDisplay');

    function computeLR(s) {
      let lrs;
      if (s < 50) lrs = 0.1;
      else if (s < 100) lrs = 0.05;
      else if (s < 150) lrs = 0.025;
      else lrs = 0.0125;

      let lrc = 0.1 * 0.5 * (1 + Math.cos(Math.PI * s / 200));

      let lrw, wp;
      if (s < 50) {
        lrw = 0.01 + (0.1 - 0.01) * (s / 50);
        wp = true;
      } else {
        lrw = 0.1 * 0.5 * (1 + Math.cos(Math.PI * (s - 50) / 150));
        wp = false;
      }

      return { lrs, lrc, lrw, wp };
    }

    function updateState() {
      const vals = computeLR(step);
      lr_step = vals.lrs;
      lr_cosine = vals.lrc;
      lr_warmup = vals.lrw;
      warmup_phase = vals.wp;
    }

    function updateDisplay() {
      stepDisplay.textContent = step;
      lrStepDisplay.textContent = lr_step.toFixed(3);
      lrCosineDisplay.textContent = lr_cosine.toFixed(3);
      lrWarmupDisplay.textContent = lr_warmup.toFixed(3);
      phaseDisplay.textContent = warmup_phase ? 'warmup' : 'decay';
    }

    function draw() {
      const ink = tok('--ink');
      const text2 = tok('--text2');
      const line = tok('--line');
      const bg = tok('--card');
      const accent = tok('--accent');

      ctx.clearRect(0, 0, W, H);

      ctx.fillStyle = bg;
      ctx.fillRect(0, 0, W, H);

      ctx.strokeStyle = line;
      ctx.lineWidth = 0.5;
      ctx.setLineDash([3, 4]);
      for (let lr = 0; lr <= maxLR; lr += 0.05) {
        const y = padT + plotH * (1 - lr / maxLR);
        ctx.beginPath();
        ctx.moveTo(padL, y);
        ctx.lineTo(W - padR, y);
        ctx.stroke();
      }
      for (let s = 0; s <= maxStep; s += 50) {
        const x = padL + plotW * (s / maxStep);
        ctx.beginPath();
        ctx.moveTo(x, padT);
        ctx.lineTo(x, padT + plotH);
        ctx.stroke();
      }
      ctx.setLineDash([]);

      ctx.fillStyle = text2;
      ctx.font = '10px ' + tok('--mono');
      ctx.textAlign = 'center';
      ctx.textBaseline = 'top';
      for (let s = 0; s <= maxStep; s += 50) {
        const x = padL + plotW * (s / maxStep);
        ctx.fillText(s, x, padT + plotH + 6);
      }
      ctx.textAlign = 'right';
      ctx.textBaseline = 'middle';
      for (let lr = 0; lr <= maxLR; lr += 0.05) {
        const y = padT + plotH * (1 - lr / maxLR);
        ctx.fillText(lr.toFixed(2), padL - 6, y);
      }
      ctx.textAlign = 'left';
      ctx.fillText('lr', padL, padT - 12);

      function drawCurve(color, computeFn) {
        ctx.strokeStyle = color;
        ctx.lineWidth = 2;
        ctx.beginPath();
        for (let s = 0; s <= step; s++) {
          const x = padL + plotW * (s / maxStep);
          const val = computeFn(s);
          const y = padT + plotH * (1 - val / maxLR);
          if (s === 0) ctx.moveTo(x, y);
          else ctx.lineTo(x, y);
        }
        ctx.stroke();
      }

      drawCurve(accent, (s) => {
        if (s < 50) return 0.1;
        if (s < 100) return 0.05;
        if (s < 150) return 0.025;
        return 0.0125;
      });

      drawCurve(accent, (s) => 0.1 * 0.5 * (1 + Math.cos(Math.PI * s / 200)));

      drawCurve(accent, (s) => {
        if (s < 50) return 0.01 + (0.1 - 0.01) * (s / 50);
        return 0.1 * 0.5 * (1 + Math.cos(Math.PI * (s - 50) / 150));
      });

      const curX = padL + plotW * (step / maxStep);
      ctx.strokeStyle = ink;
      ctx.lineWidth = 1;
      ctx.setLineDash([4, 4]);
      ctx.beginPath();
      ctx.moveTo(curX, padT);
      ctx.lineTo(curX, padT + plotH);
      ctx.stroke();
      ctx.setLineDash([]);

      const dotR = 5;
      const vals = computeLR(step);
      const points = [
        { val: vals.lrs },
        { val: vals.lrc },
        { val: vals.lrw }
      ];
      for (const p of points) {
        const y = padT + plotH * (1 - p.val / maxLR);
        ctx.fillStyle = accent;
        ctx.beginPath();
        ctx.arc(curX, y, dotR, 0, Math.PI * 2);
        ctx.fill();
        ctx.strokeStyle = bg;
        ctx.lineWidth = 1.5;
        ctx.stroke();
      }
    }

    function update() {
      updateState();
      draw();
      updateDisplay();
    }

    let lastTime = 0;
    function animate(time) {
      if (playing) {
        step += 1;
        if (step > maxStep) step = 0;
        update();
      }
      requestAnimationFrame(animate);
    }

    canvas.addEventListener('click', () => {
      playing = !playing;
    });

    update();
    requestAnimationFrame(animate);
  })();
</script>", "spec": {"core_insight": "三种学习率调度策略（Step Decay、Cosine Annealing、Warmup）在训练过程中产生截然不同的学习率曲线形态，直接影响收敛行为。", "render_medium": "canvas", "render_medium_reason": "需要连续动画绘制三条动态曲线，并随时间推进实时更新，canvas 更适合这种连续运动与重绘场景。", "state_model": [{"name": "step", "type": "int", "range": "0..200", "init": 0}, {"name": "lr_step", "type": "float", "range": "0..0.2", "init": 0.1}, {"name": "lr_cosine", "type": "float", "range": "0..0.2", "init": 0.1}, {"name": "lr_warmup", "type": "float", "range": "0..0.2", "init": 0.01}, {"name": "warmup_phase", "type": "bool", "range": "true|false", "init": true}, {"name": "playing", "type": "bool", "range": "true|false", "init": true}], "interactions": [{"trigger": "canvas click", "effect": "toggle playing state; 若 playing 为 false 则暂停动画，否则继续"}, {"trigger": "animation frame (每帧)", "effect": "step += 1; 若 step > 200 则 step = 0; 根据 step 计算三条学习率曲线当前值并更新 lr_step, lr_cosine, lr_warmup, warmup_phase"}], "update": "每帧清空 canvas，根据 step 值绘制三条学习率曲线（横轴 step 0-200，纵轴 lr 0-0.2），曲线颜色区分：Step Decay 红色阶梯状，Cosine Annealing 蓝色余弦下降，Warmup 绿色先升后降；当前 step 位置用竖线标记，三条曲线当前值用对应颜色圆点高亮；底部显示当前 step 编号和三条 lr 数值。", "initial_paint": "step=10，三条曲线已从起点绘制到 step=10 位置：红色阶梯线在 step=0~50 段保持 0.1，蓝色余弦线从 0.1 缓慢下降至约 0.095，绿色 warmup 线从 0.01 上升至约 0.04（仍处于 warmup 阶段）；竖线位于 step=10，三个彩色圆点分别位于各自曲线末端；底部显示 step=10，lr_step=0.1，lr_cosine≈0.095，lr_warmup≈0.04，warmup_phase=true。"}, "id": "b21"}, {"type": "list", "items": [{"lead": "Step Decay", "text": "每隔固定轮数将学习率乘以一个衰减因子（如每 30 epoch 乘以 0.1），适合训练过程有明显阶段划分的任务，如分类模型在预训练后微调。", "icon": "microscope"}, {"lead": "Cosine Annealing", "text": "学习率按余弦曲线从初始值平滑下降至接近零，无需手动设定衰减节点，在图像生成、Transformer 训练中常见，能缓解后期震荡。", "icon": "trending-down"}, {"lead": "Warmup", "text": "训练初期从极小学习率线性增长到目标值，避免模型参数剧烈更新导致不稳定，常用于大 batch size 或深层网络（如 ResNet、BERT）。", "icon": "wifi"}], "id": "b22"}, {"type": "callout", "label": "核心转变", "text": "固定学习率是**空间换速度**，自适应调度是**时间换收敛质量**——早期大步快跑、后期小步精调，以更长的训练步数换取更稳定的收敛结果。", "id": "b23"}], "layout": {"kind": "compose", "areas": [{"blockIds": ["b21"], "col": [1, 9]}, {"blockIds": ["b22"], "col": [1, 7]}, {"blockIds": ["b23"], "col": [7, 11]}]}}, "referenceMaterial": "[none provided]"}

